<h2>Dosido 0.11.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>Dosido now tells you when an update is ready: the menu bar icon shows a dot, and the menu starts with &quot;Update to…&quot;.</li>
<li>New &quot;Update automatically&quot; option in the menu. Turn it on and Dosido installs updates in the background when it is not busy and Ableton Live is closed.</li>
<li>Bug fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
